WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.500
Let’s walk through Tribe Street Journal.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.088
Read or prepare reporting with its source context intact.

00:00:06.088 --> 00:00:10.125
Distinguish observation, selected quote, scenario reporting, and

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:13.100
White Cell publication so participants can judge what kind of

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.988
evidence they are receiving.

00:00:14.988 --> 00:00:18.262
On this slide, review captures and prepare selected field

00:00:18.262 --> 00:00:20.387
intelligence for publication.

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:24.425
In practice, publish deliberately and preserve the source context

00:00:24.425 --> 00:00:28.212
so teams can distinguish observation from White Cell inject.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.598
When you are ready, use Open Tribe Street Journal

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:33.485
to move to the live surface.

00:00:33.485 --> 00:00:36.210
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:36.360
.
